Package: sorenR
Title: Experimental Self-Organizing Representations with Bounded Updates
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pure R experimental prototype graph representation with a
    deterministic out-of-sample map, frozen preprocessing, bounded replay,
    and transactional updates checked against a finite-anchor displacement
    budget. Support scores are uncalibrated and methodological superiority
    is not established.
